    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "SAN FRANCISCO /\nOAKLAND\nEFFECTIVE JUNE 1, 1964\nUNITED\nUNITED JETS\nTO HAWAII...\nECONOMY COACH JETS\nONLY $100\nCUSTOM COACH JETS\nONLY $110*\n(see map page)",
      "SAN FRANCISCO /\nOAKLAND\nEFFECTIVE JUNE 1, 1964\nUNITED\n16\nUNITED JETS\nTO HAWAII...\nECONOMY COACH JETS\nONLY $100\nCUSTOM COACH JETS\nONLY $110*\n(see map page)",
      "VANCOUVER, B. C\nONOLULU\nBROKANE\nPORTLAND\nSALEM\nEUGENE\nPENDLETON\nBOISE\nMEDFORD\nELKO\nSAN FRANCISCO\nOAKLAND\nRAMENTO\nSTOCKTON\nELY\nMONTEREY\nSALINAS\nMERCED\nFRESNO\nVISALIA\nBAKERSFIELD\nLAS VEGAS\nSANTA BARBARA\nLOS ANGELES\nSAN DIEGO.\nSALT LAKE CITY\nGRAND JUNCTION\nDENVER\nUNITED FLIES BY ELGIN WATCH TIME\nTRANSCONTINENTAL NONSTOP JET SERVICE\nSEATTLE TACOMA\n/NEW YORK\n• PHILADELPHIA\nSAN FRANCISCO\nWASHINGTON\nMINNEAPOLIS-ST. PAUL\nOMAHA\nLINCOLN\nSAGINAW BAY CHY MIDLAND\nMUSKEOG\nROCHESTER\nGUEEALO\nMILWAUKEE\nBOSTON\nHARTFORe-SPRING\nSFIELD\nLMIRA-CORNING\nPROVIDENCE\nGRAND RAPTU\nDETROIT\nYOUNGSTOWN-WARRE\nCAGO\nFORT WAYNE\nAKRON CANTO\nPITTSBURGH\nISBURG YORK\nNEW YORK\nNEWARK\nIN BETHLEHEM EASTON\nPHILADELPHIA\nMOLINE-ROCK\nAND-DAVENPORT\nDAYTON\nCOLUMBUS\nCHARLESTON, W. VA\nRICHMOND\nBALTIMORE\nWASHINGTON\nNEWPORT NEWS HAMPTON\nWILLIAMSBURG\nNORFOLK PORTSMOUTH\nBRISTOR KINGSPORT-JOHNSON CITY\nKANSAS CIT\nGREENSBORO-HIGH POINT.\nWINSTON SALEM\nKNOXVILLE\nASHEVILLE\nCHATTANOOGA\nRALEIGH-DURHAM\nCHARLOT\nMEMPHIS\nHUNTSVIL\nATLANTA\nBIRMINGHAM\nMOBILE\nJACKSON VILLE\nNEW ORLEANS\nTAMPA\nST. PETERSBURG:\nCLEARWATER\nWEST PALM BEACH\nFORT LAUDERDALE\nMIAMI\nUNITED INCREASES JET SCHEDULES\nTO HAWAII • • • 23 JETS A WEEK+\nUnited offers you a wide choice of service and\nschedules to Hawaii... a total of 23 flights\nweekly to Hawaii. Here are some of the features\nof Custom Coach service: Your choice of cock-\ntails or champagne for your aloha toast!. A\ndelicious full-course meal specially prepared in\nour world-famous flight kitchens!. A Hawaiian\nsteward and colorfully attired stewardesses to\nprovide excellent in-flight service! All this for $23\nless than ever before.\n*Effective June 1 Subject to Government Approval\n¡Schedules Effective June 5\nUNITED\nTHE EXTRA CARE AIRLINE"
